				</div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="contact" class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="contact-card">
				<h2 class="contact-title">Let's connect</h2>
				<p>
					I'm currently looking for new opportunities as an Android
					Developer. Whether you have a question or just want to say
